  "exposure_disclosure": [
    "The mandatory oeis-row8/report.md disclosed a Knuth estimate of 7.47e12 total n=10 safe subsets, SE 0.217e12, and a runtime estimate. Neither forecast nor its band is fitted to that total.",
    "The mandatory sampler reports displayed n=10 endpoint calibration estimates. The exact endpoint 1135 is prior work and is explicitly conditioned on, not a blind prediction.",
